OL,3,ASearch for cruise ship passenger feared
OL,4,Ato have fallen overboard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major search has been launched after
OL,7,Fa passenger was reported missing from a
OL,8,Fcruise ship docked in Dundee.
OL,10,FLifeboats and coastguard crews are
OL,11,Fsearching for the man who is feared to
OL,12,Fhave fallen from the Ambassador
OL,13,FAmbition before it arrived in the city
OL,14,Fon Friday.
OL,16,FIt is understood that the passenger's
OL,17,Fluggage was still onboard and his bed
OL,18,Fhad not been slept in.
OL,20,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said the
OL,21,Fman's next of kin had been made aware
OL,22,Fand inquiries were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
